Query event(RegularCredentialAccepted12(G,D,PK,T,S,NJ)) ==> event(SignerValidated(C2,D,PK,T,S,e0,N2)) is true.

Query event(RegularCredentialAccepted13(G,D,PK,T,S,NJ)) ==> event(SignerValidated(C3,D,PK,T,S,e0,N3)) is true.

Query event(RegularCredentialAccepted23(G,D,PK,T,S,NJ)) ==> event(SignerValidated(C2,D,PK,T,S,e0,N2)) && event(SignerValidated(C3,D,PK,T,S,e0,N3)) is true.

Query not event(ShareActivated(O1,E,pkChord,S)) is true.

Query not event(ShareActivated(Dreg,E,pkChord,S)) is true.

Query not attacker_bitstring(reachSetup[]) is false.

Query not attacker_bitstring(reachShare1Leak[]) is false.

Query not attacker_bitstring(reachRepresentativeOverlayForwarding[]) is false.

Query not attacker_bitstring(reachPair12MembershipAuthorized[]) is false.

Query not attacker_bitstring(reachPair13MembershipAuthorized[]) is false.

Query not attacker_bitstring(reachPair23MembershipAuthorized[]) is false.

